Summary
=======

Problem:
Unauthorized or misconfigured links can affect EtherChannel operation.

Solution:
Use LACP to validate and negotiate EtherChannel membership.

Benefit:
More secure and reliable than static EtherChannel (Mode ON).

Limitation:
Does not protect against broadcast storms or excessive traffic.

